    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Clifford Street, Wexford Town, Co. Wexford, Y35 P7D3.\n\nSituated in a sought-after and convenient location in the heart of Wexford Town, this mid-terrace townhouse presents an exciting opportunity for anyone looking to take on a renovation project and create a home of their own.\n\nExtending to approximately 75 sq. m., the property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, with the added benefit of a recently upgraded oiol fired central heating system, a small front garden and a rear garden.\n\nWhile the property is in need of some modernisation and some TLC, it is the location and potential that make this an opportunity worth exploring. For those willing to roll up their sleeves and look beyond its current condition, this is a chance to put their own stamp on a town centre property and transform it into something truly special.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a two reception rooms, a kitchen, a bathroom fitted with w.c, w.h.b and shower. Upstairs, there are two further bedrooms, including a spacious primary bedroom overlooking the front of the property, while the third bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes.\n\nThe location is a particular highlight. With Bride Street Church just around the corner and an excellent range of amenities within easy walking distance, the property is ideally positioned for convenient town centre living. Tesco is approximately a five-minute walk away, while local schools, including Presentation Secondary and CBS Primary and Secondary schools, preschools, shops, cafés and other everyday amenities are all close at hand. The popular Chin's Can Cook takeaway is also within comfortable walking distance.\n\nOnline virtual tour available. To view contact Rob McCormack.\n\n*The gardens and furniture are due to be cleared."
      },
